00:00:21.020 --> 00:00:24.230
Push it, push it, push it,
push it, push it, Fukuho!

00:00:21.160 --> 00:00:23.370
Unyielding

00:00:31.440 --> 00:00:32.940
Subaru Mimura...

00:00:32.940 --> 00:00:34.190
What's he doing here?

00:00:34.190 --> 00:00:37.730
Sorry that I blocked so hard.

00:00:37.730 --> 00:00:39.100
Is your nose okay?

00:00:39.100 --> 00:00:44.350
Y-Yeah. It's not broken
or anything. It's just bleeding.

00:00:44.350 --> 00:00:46.980
I see. Glad to hear it.

00:00:46.980 --> 00:00:48.600
I think you already know,

00:00:48.600 --> 00:00:51.690
but our manager broke his arm and isn't here.

00:00:51.690 --> 00:00:55.730
I'd hate for two people from our teams
to end up in the hospital in one day.

00:00:55.730 --> 00:00:57.270
Your relief just pisses me off.

00:00:57.270 --> 00:00:58.810
Hey!

00:00:58.810 --> 00:01:01.480
Did I say it in an annoying way?

00:01:01.480 --> 00:01:08.810
I mean, it's honestly lucky for us
that your ace isn't in the game right now.

00:01:08.810 --> 00:01:13.020
We're not exactly in the condition
to take you on at your best.

00:01:15.060 --> 00:01:19.980
You can let your guard down, though.
This was just a personal visit.

00:01:21.600 --> 00:01:24.850
Just don't get any weird injuries.

00:01:24.850 --> 00:01:27.850
It really sucks not being
able to play volleyball.

00:01:29.270 --> 00:01:30.400
Well, I'm gonna head back.

00:01:30.400 --> 00:01:34.650
Um... Have you gotten hurt before?

00:01:34.650 --> 00:01:39.150
I don't need the enemy team knowing
my weaknesses, so that's a secret.

00:01:39.150 --> 00:01:41.940
This is my last Spring Tournament.

00:01:41.940 --> 00:01:44.150
I don't intend to let
anyone else have that ticket.

00:01:44.150 --> 00:01:48.100
I won't say that I'm glad that the
enemy team's ace is out of the game

00:01:48.100 --> 00:01:51.730
because that lacks sportsmanship.

00:01:51.730 --> 00:01:59.150
And so, we're going to end
Seiin's volleyball here, fair and square.

00:02:02.190 --> 00:02:04.350
Seiin's volleyball...

00:02:05.400 --> 00:02:07.850
<i>We were so scared that we went numb</i>

00:02:07.850 --> 00:02:10.230
<i>And our legs buckled from under us</i>

00:02:10.230 --> 00:02:15.190
<i>We still can't forget the tears</i>
<i>that fell back then even now</i>

