00:07:38.770 --> 00:07:42.940
Is it normal to feel protected?

00:07:42.940 --> 00:07:47.020
Were you talking about Oda- <i>senpai</i> ?

00:07:47.020 --> 00:07:51.730
Or maybe everyone else on our team.

00:07:51.730 --> 00:07:55.400
Gramps, Grams, your dad...

00:07:55.400 --> 00:07:57.900
Everyone that's cheering us on...

00:07:59.350 --> 00:08:01.560
Everyone's watching you.

00:08:01.560 --> 00:08:03.100
They're watching over you.

00:08:03.100 --> 00:08:07.850
We know how serious you are about this game.

00:08:07.850 --> 00:08:11.440
This is where you belong, so...

00:08:13.190 --> 00:08:15.230
Let's give this everything we've got!

00:08:19.770 --> 00:08:21.270
Yuni Kuroba...

00:08:23.150 --> 00:08:24.600
...is back!

00:08:25.980 --> 00:08:28.190
