00:08:27.350 --> 00:08:29.600
How's the match going?

00:08:29.600 --> 00:08:32.810
We're in the fourth set. It's 18 to 20.

00:08:32.810 --> 00:08:34.150
We're losing.

00:08:34.150 --> 00:08:36.770
All right. We're almost there.

00:08:36.770 --> 00:08:37.940
We'll be waiting!

