00:10:54.270 --> 00:10:55.770
And now...

00:10:57.900 --> 00:10:59.440
Subaru!

00:10:59.440 --> 00:11:02.400
Go, go, go, go, go, Subaru!

00:11:02.400 --> 00:11:05.690
Push it, push it, push it,
push it, push it, Subaru!

00:11:08.400 --> 00:11:09.730
Subaru!

00:11:28.480 --> 00:11:33.190
I've got so many things
I have to protect. It's sorta insane.

00:11:33.190 --> 00:11:38.100
That responsibility and people counting
on me is what gives me strength.

00:11:38.100 --> 00:11:39.770
That's why...

00:11:44.480 --> 00:11:46.650
...I'm not going to lose to anyone.

00:11:45.550 --> 00:11:46.760
Seiin

00:11:45.550 --> 00:11:46.760
Fukuho Tech

00:11:47.480 --> 00:11:49.100
Subaru!

00:11:49.100 --> 00:11:52.100
One more point! One more point!

00:11:49.220 --> 00:11:53.560
Seiin

00:11:52.100 --> 00:11:54.560
Subaru! Go hard!

00:11:52.600 --> 00:11:54.690
Fukuho Tech

00:11:56.400 --> 00:11:57.270
Out!

00:12:01.520 --> 00:12:03.520
They're split on their decision!

00:12:04.770 --> 00:12:07.350
If it's out, then it's a deuce.

00:12:11.980 --> 00:12:15.400
If it's in... the game's over.

00:12:20.190 --> 00:12:22.190
Out.

00:12:22.190 --> 00:12:23.560
Deuce!

00:12:23.560 --> 00:12:25.520
Did he seriously just...

00:12:27.940 --> 00:12:29.900
That kid's got guts.

