00:13:13.940 --> 00:13:16.900
And now, we're even.

00:13:16.900 --> 00:13:19.150
We're going right into the final set!

00:13:21.020 --> 00:13:23.150
They took it...

00:13:23.150 --> 00:13:25.100
Ochi!

00:13:25.100 --> 00:13:26.900
Get down here!

00:13:26.900 --> 00:13:28.520
Subaru...

00:13:28.520 --> 00:13:29.980
Come on!

00:13:31.650 --> 00:13:33.850
Coach...

00:13:35.690 --> 00:13:36.350
I'm gonna go down there.

00:13:36.350 --> 00:13:37.940
Right!

00:13:36.500 --> 00:13:40.960
Fukuho Tech

00:13:46.650 --> 00:13:50.020
Rejoice, guys! Look who's back on our bench!

00:13:50.020 --> 00:13:51.690
It's our goddess of victory!

00:13:51.690 --> 00:13:54.100
Uh... Who the hell are you calling a goddess?

00:13:54.100 --> 00:13:56.940
Now let's hear some words
from our goddess to grant us victory.

00:13:56.940 --> 00:13:58.770
Honestly, you're so...

00:13:58.770 --> 00:14:01.350
Mitsuomi, we're counting on you.

00:14:04.810 --> 00:14:10.230
Guys, take me to the center court at the
Spring Tournament! Go out there, and win!

00:14:10.230 --> 00:14:11.600
Yeah!

00:14:14.020 --> 00:14:15.230
Coach.

00:14:17.270 --> 00:14:23.480
Thank you, Coach, for keeping me
registered as the manager.

00:14:23.480 --> 00:14:26.150
When you're not on the bench,

00:14:26.150 --> 00:14:30.020
I might be the one who
feels your absence the most.

00:14:32.600 --> 00:14:33.770
Oda...

00:14:34.900 --> 00:14:37.100
He's coming out onto the court.

00:14:37.100 --> 00:14:39.230
This is gonna be an all-out battle.

00:14:39.230 --> 00:14:42.060
Now, we've got you back...

00:14:42.060 --> 00:14:42.980
It's definitely an all-out battle.

00:14:43.110 --> 00:14:45.320
The 4th set

00:14:47.320 --> 00:14:48.740
Begins

00:14:50.230 --> 00:14:54.060
In the last set, whoever gets
15 points first wins.

00:14:54.060 --> 00:14:55.690
We need to be the first to score--

00:14:57.520 --> 00:14:58.980
A dump?!

00:15:00.230 --> 00:15:02.980
Is he seriously just a first year?

00:15:02.980 --> 00:15:07.060
Haijima's not the only scary guy
on their team right now.

00:15:07.060 --> 00:15:10.310
Their whole team is growing
as the match goes along.

00:15:10.310 --> 00:15:12.400
Because they have him,

00:15:12.400 --> 00:15:17.650
the other players are also
improving at incredible speed.

00:15:17.650 --> 00:15:22.310
Even then... I don't think
he would've fit with our team.

00:15:22.310 --> 00:15:24.940
There's only one person who sits
on the throne at Fukuho.

00:15:27.100 --> 00:15:28.560
We don't need another one.

00:15:32.060 --> 00:15:33.060
Subaru!

00:15:43.440 --> 00:15:44.650
My bad.

00:15:44.650 --> 00:15:46.810
No worries.

00:15:46.810 --> 00:15:48.350
Yeah!

00:15:52.980 --> 00:15:56.190
He'll smile, even if we're at a disadvantage.

00:15:57.480 --> 00:16:00.940
He'll never do anything
to make the team anxious.

