00:16:30.480 --> 00:16:31.560
Subaru!

00:16:34.720 --> 00:16:36.680
Seiin

00:16:34.720 --> 00:16:36.680
Fukuho Tech

00:16:38.520 --> 00:16:40.270
Let's cut them off with this one!

00:16:40.270 --> 00:16:41.100
Ochi...

00:16:41.100 --> 00:16:43.060
Yes.

00:16:43.060 --> 00:16:44.850
I'm sure you wanted to play.

00:16:47.940 --> 00:16:53.310
I'm very proud at the fact that I got
to be their manager for three years.

00:16:53.310 --> 00:16:55.520
But...

00:16:55.520 --> 00:16:56.940
Yeah!

00:16:56.940 --> 00:17:00.560
Of course, I wanted to stand
on the court with Subaru.

00:17:00.560 --> 00:17:03.940
I wanted to play volleyball with him.

00:17:05.020 --> 00:17:06.690
Hey, Subaru...

00:17:06.690 --> 00:17:11.150
Everyone who's been involved
with volleyball in this prefecture...

00:17:11.150 --> 00:17:13.650
There's no way...

00:17:13.650 --> 00:17:17.560
That any of them want
Subaru Mimura or Fukuho to lose.

00:17:17.560 --> 00:17:19.230
There's no way.

00:17:20.850 --> 00:17:26.480
Seiin is a strong team and Haijima
is an extremely talented setter.

00:17:26.480 --> 00:17:35.350
But the one who's going to smile
and take in everyone's cheers and dreams

00:17:35.350 --> 00:17:38.770
and take them to the center court in Tokyo...

00:17:42.650 --> 00:17:44.350
Yeah!

00:17:44.350 --> 00:17:51.230
Is Mimura Subaru. I'm sure everyone knows that.

