00:18:01.150 --> 00:18:02.400
That means we have to...

00:18:02.400 --> 00:18:03.310
Let's get this point!

00:18:03.310 --> 00:18:04.520
Yeah!

00:18:05.650 --> 00:18:08.560
You're not breaking yet, Subaru Mimura?

00:18:10.270 --> 00:18:15.020
Use the left more. Kuroba and I
can move all you need us to.

00:18:16.310 --> 00:18:20.400
The prefectural preliminaries
are just a checkpoint.

00:18:20.400 --> 00:18:24.400
We're going to defeat Fukuho and
be the reps. We're going to nationals!

00:18:27.560 --> 00:18:31.310
I want to settle this... I want to win...

00:18:35.270 --> 00:18:36.400
And yet...

00:18:36.400 --> 00:18:37.690
Why?

00:18:39.100 --> 00:18:41.350
Why am I even thinking this?

00:18:46.810 --> 00:18:49.770
This match is going to end soon.

00:18:52.860 --> 00:18:54.860
And I don't want it to end

00:18:53.270 --> 00:18:54.730
And I don't want it to end.

00:19:01.820 --> 00:19:03.280
Seiin

00:19:01.820 --> 00:19:03.280
Fukuho Tech

00:19:03.730 --> 00:19:05.150
Nice attempt, Aoki!

00:19:05.150 --> 00:19:07.520
Are you okay, Aoki- <i>senpai</i> ?

00:19:10.940 --> 00:19:12.850
What? You down for the count?

00:19:12.850 --> 00:19:14.520
I'm not done yet.

00:19:14.520 --> 00:19:16.690
You're not going down until we win.

00:19:16.690 --> 00:19:18.480
Of course.

